    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In conclusion, based on the information available within I context, it appears that Faber IA's could design a technical architecture for Faber IA's platform, Atelier that meets many of the specified requirements, including integration with necessary tools, sovereign hosting, and performance expectations." ;
