    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The solution certifications, the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) instruments, AI security controls, audit capabilities, and experience with EU regulatory frameworks as of 2024, can The solution ensure the security and compliance posture for this tender response?" ;
