    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Security & Compliance officer at The solution, a Security & Compliance officer at Faber IA can confirm that The solution have the necessary certifications and measures in place to ensure compliance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)." ;
