    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution is ISO 27001 certified since 2023, which covers the scope of Development, delivery, and operations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, The solution ISO 27701 certification provides a privacy information management extension." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution also comply with SecNumCloud at the hosting layer through The solution partnership with OuraneCloud, ensuring sovereign hosting of confidential data within EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution data protection measures include encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256, as well as key management on EU-based infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution implement strict partitioning with logical isolation per client and per mission, preventing any cross-client circulation of data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) compliance, The solution Data Protection Officer (DPO) is appointed, and The solution maintain a data processing register." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution data processing agreements (DPAs) are aligned with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) Article 28." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution also ensure data minimization, pseudonymisation, and configurable retention aligned with legal archival obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For security controls, The solution have role-based access control (RBAC), audit logging of access and system outputs, and secure software development lifecycle (SDLC) practices including code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; the professional validates.  3.3 Client-file handling support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution vulnerability management includes remediation SLAs by severity, and The solution incident response plan covers detection, notification, and remediation, including the 72-hour the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) breach-notification workflow." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these measures and The solution experience with EU regulatory frameworks as of 2025, a Security & Compliance officer at Faber IA am confident that The solution can ensure a robust security and compliance posture for this tender response, meeting the requirements for the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) compliance, data leakage prevention, sensitive data protection, reliability, and traceability of outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must respect professional secrecy and confidentiality, comply with accounting standards (PCG), tax doctrine, and applicable legal texts." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also guarantee the auditor's independence and separation of duties." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's legal standing, procurement experience across EU jurisdictions, IP model, insurance, standard contractual clauses, and AI regulatory posture as of 2024, can our company's manage the legal eligibility, contractual compliance, and regulatory risk for this tender response?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As Legal Agent for our company's, Legal Agent for Faber IA confirm that our company's is a Société par actions simplifiée (SAS) registered in France, with up-to-date social and fiscal obligations. our company's have experience working with private firms, regulated professions, and public-sector clients, including familiarity with professional secrecy expectations. our company's contractual experience includes negotiating terms related to service levels, penalties, reversibility, audit rights, and confidentiality undertakings, which should help our company's navigate the requirements for respecting professional secrecy and confidentiality.  our company's are also familiar with the importance of compliance with accounting standards, tax doctrine, and applicable legal texts, given our company's work with regulated professions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our company's understand the need to guarantee auditor independence and separation of duties, as reflected in our company's experience with statutory audit clients. our company's intellectual property model is based on proprietary software licensed under a subscription or usage model, which should not introduce undue risks regarding data sovereignty or confidentiality. our company's utilize permissive open-source licenses for components where applicable and provide a Software Bill of Materials (SBOM) to clients." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding insurance, our company's have professional liability insurance with a coverage of 10 million euros per claim, as well as general civil liability cover." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Certificates of insurance can be provided upon request." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's experience with EU jurisdictions and the fact that our company's maintain administrative attestations and comply with GDPR (including Article 28 processing agreements), anti-money laundering framework (LCB-FT), auditor independence, and separation-of-duties rules for statutory audits, our company's are well-positioned to manage legal eligibility, contractual compliance, and regulatory risk for this tender response. our company's AI regulatory posture as of 2024 is aligned with emerging EU AI Act requirements, further ensuring our company's capability to navigate the complex regulatory landscape associated with AI solutions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "During the handling and review of a client file, the solution must surface relevant information, recall applicable rules, propose a checklist of verifications and flag potential anomalies for human review (e.g. during the révision des comptes). the solution must support the preparation of recurring documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, based on our company's context, Legal Agent for Faber IA conclude that our company's can manage the legal eligibility, contractual compliance, and regulatory risk for this tender response." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project has a budget allocated to 220,000 over 3 years, with an annual operating cost that must remain under control." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must optimize costs and guarantee the expected quality of service." ;
