    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An engagement of 220,000 euros over 3 years is well within our company's normal deal range and financial capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, our company's can manage the financial eligibility for this tender.  our company's daily rates for various roles are also provided, which will be essential in determining the cost of delivering The project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that our company's have a comfortable cash position and our company's revenue has been increasing by approximately 40% year over year, our company's should be able to provide a competitive bid while ensuring the expected quality of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, I do not have information on our company's overhead, tender eligibility thresholds, or specific cost sensitivity parameters as of 2024 that might affect our company's ability to provide a cost-competitive bid." ;
