    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The cabinet Vauclair Associés project management methodology, which combines agile iterations with a phase-gate structure, and The cabinet Vauclair Associés past references in the public sector, such as working with a regional council and a mutual health insurer, The cabinet Vauclair Associés are confident in The cabinet Vauclair Associés ability to coordinate a consortium to provide a coherent tender response." ;
